{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55638","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱拙藏锋过暮年，高名何必指前贤。\n只於心上标空界，谁说壶中别有天。\n郁密远林停宿雾，萧骚疎竹扫寒烟。\n从兹不更移瓶锡，身外无余意了然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}